WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.002
-President Trump
picked political fights

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:05.238
and refused to take
responsibility for his rhetoric

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.306
as he visited Dayton
and El Paso today.

00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:09.609
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:13.313
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:15.949
After four years
of spewing racist

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:17.417
and anti-immigrant vitriol,

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:20.453
Trump managed to tepidly read
a script from a teleprompter

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.054
on Monday condemning bigotry.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:23.722
Of course, we all know by now

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:25.425
that when Trump reads something
from a teleprompter,

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:26.926
he doesn't actually mean it.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:30.697
More often than not, it's the
first time he's even seeing it.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:34.667
-10,000 known or "suspested"
gang members.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.836
Controlled by large "derners."

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:42.675
He has worked in both houses of
Congress advising "lawmarkers."

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.310
-Yes.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.446
Lawmarkers, as in Congress
should pass gun control now.

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:50.816
When they do, they can write it
down with lawmarker.

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:54.653
I have a feeling Trump doesn't
even read these speeches first.

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:58.357
You can tell because he does
this thing where he reads a line

00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:00.826
and then he reacts to it
in real time.

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:05.865
-We know that our nation
was founded by farmers.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:10.003
Our independence
was won by farmers.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.539
Our continent was tamed
by farmers.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:14.573
So true.

00:01:14.573 --> 00:01:16.575
-I mean, it's like --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:20.146
It's like your mom reading
her fortune cookie at dinner.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:23.115
"A faithful friend
is a strong defense."

00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:24.183
So true.

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.252
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.588
And yet --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:33.859
And yet Trump's aides
and even some in the media

00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:35.828
are actually trying to pretend
that this is a speech

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.563
we were supposed to
take seriously

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:39.332
and that Trump actually meant
what he said,

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.500
despite everything we know
about him from his campaign,

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.036
his presidency,
and most of his adult life.

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:47.072
-The accusation is that
the culture he foments

00:01:47.072 --> 00:01:49.442
at his rallies leads to
this kind of violence.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.809
How do you respond to that?

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:53.379
-That is absolutely ridiculous.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:55.247
-Would it help if everyone
were more careful

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:56.149
with their language?

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:57.550
-Well, I think it's pretty clear

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.385
that the President came forth
on Monday

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.388
and was very deliberate
in what he wanted to say.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.556
-No, he wasn't.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.992
Trump's not deliberate
in anything he does.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:08.061
He doesn't even stand
deliberately.

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:10.730
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.198
I mean, look at him.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:15.301
He looks like he's on the deck
of a ship about to tilt over.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.769
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:20.239
He stands like Wile E. Coyote
on those rocket skates.

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:22.308
[ Laughter,
cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.644 --> 00:02:29.649
He looks like he's posing with
Jack on the bow of the Titanic.

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:31.217
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:33.619
Not only was he not deliberate
about what he said,

00:02:33.619 --> 00:02:36.222
he didn't even get the name
of one of the cities right,

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.024
when he, of course, said Toledo,

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:40.226
even though the teleprompter
said Texas and Ohio.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.228
Now, today, Trump visited
El Paso and Dayton,

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:43.863
where he was greeted
by protesters,

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:45.764
and earlier this week,
ahead of his visit,

00:02:45.764 --> 00:02:48.735
the mayor of Dayton offered this
response to Trump's mistake.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.035
-He said sometime this week.

00:02:50.035 --> 00:02:51.671
I mean, I've heard that
he's coming Wednesday,

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:52.972
but I've not gotten a call.

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:54.774
And, you know,
he might be going to Toledo.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.476
I don't know.
-And honestly...

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.544
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.544 --> 00:02:59.078
...maybe that's
our best hope here.

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:01.146
Trump accidentally goes
to Toledo, gets lost,

00:03:01.146 --> 00:03:02.548
and spends the rest of his life

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:05.351
as the announcer
for the Mud Hens.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:08.121
"Anderson comes into the game
batting .250.

00:03:08.121 --> 00:03:08.988
So true."

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.389
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.389 --> 00:03:11.757
In fact, Trump was once again

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:14.126
back to insulting other people
on Twitter again today,

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:15.961
going after El Paso native
Beto O'Rourke

00:03:15.961 --> 00:03:17.697
for calling Trump
a white nationalist

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:20.633
and blaming him for inciting
racism, which he obviously has.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:22.902
If you accused a normal person
of being a white supremacist,

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.270
they might be shocked
and appalled

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.005
and they'd definitely want
to know why you think that.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:28.975
Instead, Trump has responded
by tweeting nasty insults.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.576
-Trump wrote this, "Beto --

00:03:30.576 --> 00:03:33.145
phony name to indicate
Hispanic heritage --

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:35.681
O'Rourke, who is embarrassed
by my last visit

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:38.117
to the great state of Texas,
where I trounced him,

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:40.219
and is now even more embarrassed

00:03:40.219 --> 00:03:43.089
by polling at 1%
in the Democrat primary,

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:47.360
should respect the victims and
law enforcement and be quiet."

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:50.430
-Okay, first of all, you don't
get to follow an insane screed

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.832
mocking his name
and his standing in the polls

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:55.000
with "respect the victims
and be quiet."

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.270
That's like if a librarian
got up and screamed,

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:59.671
"Everyone keep your
[bleep] voices down!"

00:03:59.671 --> 00:04:01.006
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:01.006 --> 00:04:04.977
Second, he --
he should be quiet?

00:04:04.977 --> 00:04:07.513
He's from El Paso,
consoling mourners,

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:08.681
standing up for his community.

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:10.449
You, meanwhile,
never shut the hell up.

00:04:10.449 --> 00:04:11.684
For example, here's Trump

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:13.686
attacking Joe Biden
later in the morning

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:16.288
for comparing him to
segregationist George Wallace.

00:04:16.288 --> 00:04:19.825
-Joe Biden says you have more
in common with George Wallace

00:04:19.825 --> 00:04:21.260
than George Washington.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.863
-Well, you know, Joe is
a pretty incompetent guy.

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:25.365
I've watched his interviews.

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:27.700
I've watched what he said
and how he said it.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:31.270
And I wouldn't have rated him
very high in the first place,

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:34.206
but Joe Biden has truly
lost his fastball.

00:04:34.206 --> 00:04:35.541
That I can tell you.

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.276
-He's lost his fastball?

00:04:37.276 --> 00:04:38.511
I'm sorry, but you don't

00:04:38.511 --> 00:04:40.579
get to criticize
someone else's fastball

00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:43.449
when immediately after
that question you wander off,

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:46.252
forget that your wife
is standing off-camera,

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:48.788
and then just
stand there awkwardly

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:51.690
in front of the cameras
while you wait for her.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.559
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:05.537
First of all, I love
how he points to the puddle

00:05:05.537 --> 00:05:06.839
and she just walks
around it like,

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:08.241
"I [bleep] know
there's a puddle."

00:05:08.241 --> 00:05:10.242
[ Laughter ]

00:05:10.242 --> 00:05:12.778
Second, why is his move
when he gets lost

00:05:12.778 --> 00:05:15.981
to just stand completely still
in front of the cameras?

00:05:15.981 --> 00:05:18.584
Does he not know
we can still see him?

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:22.554
"Maybe I can change color
to match the background.

00:05:22.554 --> 00:05:25.424
Be green."

00:05:25.424 --> 00:05:27.559
In that same Q&amp;A,

00:05:27.559 --> 00:05:30.295
Trump also refused to take
any responsibility whatsoever

00:05:30.295 --> 00:05:32.298
for his racist,
anti-immigrant rhetoric

00:05:32.298 --> 00:05:34.300
and was asked about the rise
of white supremacy.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.736
Now, just last month,
Trump's own FBI director

00:05:37.736 --> 00:05:40.640
said the FBI had recorded about
100 domestic terrorism arrests

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:43.175
and that many investigations
involve white supremacy.

00:05:43.175 --> 00:05:44.710
But when he was asked about it,

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:47.413
Trump made this vague comment
where he lumped together

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:49.715
what he generally called
"any group of hate."

00:05:49.715 --> 00:05:51.450
-Mr. President,
how concerned are you

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.085
about the rise
of white supremacy,

00:05:53.085 --> 00:05:54.853
and what are you going to do
about it?

00:05:54.853 --> 00:05:59.292
-I am concerned about the rise
of any group of hate.

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:00.693
I don't like it.

00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:05.031
Any group of hate, I am --
whether it's white supremacy,

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:07.700
whether it's any other kind
of supremacy.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.103
-What other kind of supremacy?

00:06:10.103 --> 00:06:13.639
Like, the Bourne supremacy?

00:06:13.639 --> 00:06:14.874
[ Laughter ]

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:16.976
Trump still refused
to take responsibility

00:06:16.976 --> 00:06:19.545
for the fact that he spent
his campaign and presidency

00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:21.313
constantly repeating vile,
racist,

00:06:21.313 --> 00:06:23.248
dehumanizing language
about immigrants

00:06:23.248 --> 00:06:24.750
and riling up his crowds

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.552
with paranoid fantasies
of invading caravans.

00:06:27.552 --> 00:06:29.287
-This is an invasion.

00:06:29.287 --> 00:06:33.058
I was badly criticized
for using the word "invasion."

00:06:33.058 --> 00:06:34.526
It's an invasion.

00:06:34.526 --> 00:06:37.329
People hate the word "invasion,"
but that's what it is.

00:06:37.329 --> 00:06:39.966
It's an invasion of drugs
and criminals and people.

00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:44.136
Mexico should step up
and stop this onslaught,

00:06:44.136 --> 00:06:46.271
this invasion into our country.

00:06:46.271 --> 00:06:52.278
The Democrats want to invite
caravan after caravan

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:55.514
of illegal aliens
into our country.

00:06:55.514 --> 00:06:58.584
A large group of people,
they call it a caravan.

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:00.920
[ Crowd booing ]

00:07:03.956 --> 00:07:07.159
Do you know how
the caravan started?

00:07:07.159 --> 00:07:10.029
Does everybody know
what this means?

00:07:10.029 --> 00:07:13.065
I think the Democrats
had something to do with it.

00:07:13.065 --> 00:07:15.434
-What is that move?

00:07:15.434 --> 00:07:17.169
He looks like one of those guys

00:07:17.169 --> 00:07:19.371
handing out free CDs
in Times Square.

00:07:19.371 --> 00:07:23.943
"Check out my album, 'Now That's
What I Call Racism.'"

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.511
Anyone --

00:07:25.511 --> 00:07:29.382
Anyone who's been paying
any attention at all

00:07:29.382 --> 00:07:30.783
can see what Trump is doing.

00:07:30.783 --> 00:07:32.685
He's been inciting
and promoting racism

00:07:32.685 --> 00:07:34.086
by using dehumanizing language

00:07:34.086 --> 00:07:36.055
about desperate migrants
seeking asylum,

00:07:36.055 --> 00:07:38.724
whipping his crowds into
a racist paranoid frenzy,

00:07:38.724 --> 00:07:41.460
and yet his allies on Fox News
continue to insist

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.062
that the language Trump uses,

00:07:43.062 --> 00:07:45.965
language echoed by white
supremacists, is not racist.

00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:47.900
Here's "Fox &amp; Friends" host
Brian Kilmeade

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.468
trying to make that argument
yesterday.

00:07:49.468 --> 00:07:53.238
-When you have over 110,000
people coming a month,

00:07:53.238 --> 00:07:55.541
over a million last year

00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:57.776
and then well over a million
this year,

00:07:57.776 --> 00:08:00.078
if you use the term
"it's an invasion,"

00:08:00.078 --> 00:08:02.348
that's not anti-Hispanic,
it's a fact.

00:08:02.348 --> 00:08:05.250
If the Russians were coming
through Alaska, through Canada,

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.653
the President would be using
the same language.

00:08:07.653 --> 00:08:09.588
-First of all,
yes, it is racist.

00:08:09.588 --> 00:08:12.257
Second, no, Trump would not
use the same language

00:08:12.257 --> 00:08:13.392
if it was Russians.

00:08:13.392 --> 00:08:15.360
He'd probably be out there
to greet them

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.963
like a limo driver
at the airport.

00:08:17.963 --> 00:08:22.534
Also, let me just say,
in your hypothetical scenario,

00:08:22.534 --> 00:08:24.937
if there were refugees
from Russia or anywhere else

00:08:24.937 --> 00:08:27.239
fleeing poverty and violence
and seeking asylum,

00:08:27.239 --> 00:08:29.674
they should be treated humanely
and with compassion,

00:08:29.674 --> 00:08:30.976
just like anyone else.

00:08:30.976 --> 00:08:33.044
Using a different country
doesn't help your argument.

00:08:33.044 --> 00:08:35.647
It just makes you sound like
even more of an [bleep]

00:08:35.647 --> 00:08:38.317
It's like if your uncle called
you a dick at Thanksgiving

00:08:38.317 --> 00:08:41.820
and then said, "So what? I said
the same thing about your dad."

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:43.356
And then Kilmeade kept going,

00:08:43.356 --> 00:08:45.624
also trying to defend
the President's use

00:08:45.624 --> 00:08:48.193
of the word "infestation,"
another racist trope,

00:08:48.193 --> 00:08:50.462
