the words out of his mouth.

00:08:50.462 --> 00:08:53.399
-People want to look at the
words "efest--" "infest--"

00:08:53.399 --> 00:08:56.802
"invest--" "infested" or --

00:08:56.802 --> 00:08:58.370
and look at what
the President's saying.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.972
-Whoa! Never a good sign

00:08:59.972 --> 00:09:03.242
when you're less eloquent
than teleprompter Trump.

00:09:03.242 --> 00:09:04.610
The President and his allies

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:06.778
don't think he has
any responsibility at all

00:09:06.778 --> 00:09:09.315
for the racist language
he's used against immigrants

00:09:09.315 --> 00:09:11.650
