described as assault weapons

00:09:28.867 --> 00:09:31.570
are almost invariably
no more powerful

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:33.372
than ordinary hunting rifles.

00:09:33.372 --> 00:09:34.706
They look different.

00:09:34.706 --> 00:09:37.376
You know, they're painted black
and they've got features

00:09:37.376 --> 00:09:39.511
that an ordinary hunting rifle
doesn't have,

00:09:39.511 --> 00:09:41.280
but they're no more lethal,
and --

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:42.614
-What about magazine size?

00:09:42.614 --> 00:09:44.383
