00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:56.695
You know what else is popular?
Drugs. Like, all the drugs.

00:09:56.695 --> 00:09:57.896
[ Laughter ]

00:09:57.896 --> 00:09:59.165
They're all pop--

00:09:59.165 --> 00:10:00.899
Are you in favor of making
all drugs legal, too,

00:10:00.899 --> 00:10:02.168
