00:10:02.168 --> 00:10:04.002
I would like whatever
Brian Kilmeade is smoking.

00:10:04.002 --> 00:10:07.706
-"Efest--" "infest--"
"invest--" "infested."

00:10:07.706 --> 00:10:09.508
-"Hey, you guys,
you know what's a --

00:10:09.508 --> 00:10:10.776
you know what's a funny word?

00:10:10.776 --> 00:10:11.744
'Infested.'"

00:10:11.744 --> 00:10:13.512
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:16.382
[ Mumbling ]

00:10:16.382 --> 00:10:17.750
So if we can't ban popular guns,

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:20.019
